{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/extras/3731c18ac12a788ea63ac46e1e09dbe2.avif?t=1757867563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/extras_big/3731c18ac12a788ea63ac46e1e09dbe2.avif?t=1757867563 width=800 height=84 /></span><u><strong> </strong></u> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/extras/d2fb535f5f44acb16aa5061e906c8f80.avif?t=1757867563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/extras_big/d2fb535f5f44acb16aa5061e906c8f80.avif?t=1757867563 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 Survive and Defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the teddy bear tower from relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible while managing resources and positioning strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Upgrade Your Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your Attack Power, Movement Speed, Reload Speed, and Skill Cooldown through the upgrade system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades wisely to create the perfect build for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Reroll System with Lock Mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a better upgrade? Use the Reroll feature to refresh your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock certain upgrades to keep them unchanged, but beware \u2013 the reroll cost increases with each locked stat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Challenging Waves of Enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 90 seconds, stronger and faster enemies will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty scales dynamically, ensuring every wave is more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Leaderboard and Ranking System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final score is based on remaining tower HP, player HP, and total enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the  yourself to break your previous records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Defend the teddy bear tower from enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 Earn gold and upgrade your stats to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Use the reroll system to customize your build strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 Survive as long as possible while protecting your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\ufe0f\u20e3 Compete for high scores and challenge your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Ready to Defend and Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design - eeKim,Nina</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming -\u00a0 JJoJJoong,PakaDopa,ciel45<br>Art - Hyeinjik Son,Sena Min<br>Sound - Gun kang<br>Promotion - Seohyun Yoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555050?t=1757867563","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/53b974a025e1cf0c9d46eff602669148a6a7e829/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757867563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/87276336439c509254f619ce3c3e56ee70025db1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757867563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/87276336439c509254f619ce3c3e56ee70025db1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757867563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},