ficulty scales dynamically, ensuring every wave is more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Leaderboard and Ranking System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final score is based on remaining tower HP, player HP, and total enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the  yourself to break your previous records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Defend the teddy bear tower from enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 Earn gold and upgrade your stats to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Use the reroll system to customize your build strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 Survive as long as possible while protecting your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\ufe0f\u20e3 Compete for high scores and challenge your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Ready to Defend and Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design - eeKim,Nina</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming -\u00a0 JJoJJoong,PakaDopa,ciel45<br>Art - Hyeinjik Son,Sena Min<br>Sound - Gun kang<br>Promotion - Seohyun Yoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["eeKim","Hyeonjik Son","JoJJoong","Sena Min","Nina","Gun Kang","Woosung Kim","ciel45","Seohyun Yoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555050/05ceb5712b7f94bfdec380b321d32eb35a98f90c/header.jpg?t=1757867563","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3555050/860872/2d0d38506602111df0179911fae39a3c73f76e11/1750840174/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744616434","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3555050/860872/2d0d38506602111df0179911fae39a3c73f76e11/1750840174/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744616